msgstr "Mengekstrak pengaturan ke folder eksternal"

#: temp.glade:7205
msgid "Settings can be extracted to an external folder.\n\n"
"This may be useful when examining settings from\n"
"a different user, or when there is a need to recover\n"
"lost settings from a known good PDF or Zip archive."
msgstr "Pengaturan dapat diekstrak ke folder eksternal.\n\n"
