msgstr "Warna Garis Tepi"

#: temp.glade:12563
msgid "Background Image Transparency:"
msgstr "Transparansi Gambar Latar Belakang:"

#: temp.glade:12575 temp.glade:12597
msgid "Only relevant where there is both a background image\n"
"*and* a background color. Set whether the background \n"
"image should come above or behind the color. Line art \n"
"PDFs with a tranpsarent background may display better\n"
"above the color layer, as the color layer will not then \n"
"wash them out, but .JPGs are probably better behind,\n"
"as .JPG images do not have transparency."
msgstr "Hanya relevan jika ada gambar latar *dan* warna latar \n"
"belakang. Atur apakah gambar latar belakang harus \n"
"berada di depan atau di belakang warna. PDF seni garis \n"
"dengan latar belakang transparan mungkin tampilnya \n"
"lebih baik di depan lapisan warna, karena lapisan warna \n"
"tidak akan memucatkannya, tetapi gambar .JPG mungkin \n"
"lebih baik di belakang, karena gambar .JPG tidak memiliki \n"
"sifat transparansi."

